<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>KNet Mobile Setup Center</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0f172a;
            --card-bg: #1e293b;
            --text-primary: #f8fafc;
            --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
            --accent-color: #6366f1;
            --accent-hover: #4f46e5;
            --border-color: #334155;
        }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 24px 16px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 540px;
            width: 100%;
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            margin: 0 0 8px 0;
            color: var(--text-primary);
        }
        .header p {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 14px;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .card {
            background-color: var(--card-bg);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-color);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .card-title {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-top: 0;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        .btn {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            background-color: var(--accent-color);
            color: #ffffff;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 14px 0;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 15px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: background-color 0.2s;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        .btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--accent-hover);
        }
        ol {
            margin: 0;
            padding-left: 20px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        li {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #312e81;
            color: #c7d2fe;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-left: 8px;
        }
        .info-box {
            background-color: #1e1b4b;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent-color);
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #e0e7ff;
            margin-top: 12px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>[KNet Mobile Setup]</h1>
            <p>Configure device proxy &amp; install Root CA certificate</p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-title">[Proxy Server Info]</div>
            <div class="info-box">
                <strong>Host IP:</strong> {{DESKTOP_IP}}<br>
                <strong>Port:</strong> {{PROXY_PORT}}
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-title">[Apple Setup Guide (iOS, iPadOS, macOS)] <span class="badge">Apple / Darwin</span></div>
            <a href="/knet-ca.mobileconfig" class="btn">[Download Apple Profile (.mobileconfig)]</a>
            <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Installation Steps:</strong></p>
            <ol>
                <li>Tap [Download Apple Profile] above and select <strong>Allow</strong>.</li>
                <li>Open <strong>Settings &gt; Profile Downloaded &gt; Install</strong>.</li>
                <li>Open <strong>Settings &gt; General &gt; About &gt; Certificate Trust Settings</strong>.</li>
                <li>Toggle <strong>Full Trust for Root Certificates</strong> for KNet Root CA.</li>
            </ol>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <div class="card-title">[Android Setup Guide] <span class="badge">Android</span></div>
            <a href="/knet-ca.crt" class="btn">[Download Android Certificate]</a>
            <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 13px; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 8px;"><strong>Installation Steps:</strong></p>
            <ol>
                <li>Tap [Download Android Certificate] above.</li>
                <li>Open <strong>Settings &gt; Security &gt; Encryption &amp; credentials</strong>.</li>
                <li>Select <strong>Install a certificate &gt; CA certificate</strong> and pick `knet-ca.crt`.</li>
            </ol>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
